    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>武器（战锤），极珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这把魔法锤具有3发充能。以一个附赠动作，你可以消耗1发充能并用这把锤子敲击地面。此举将在敲击位置的地面上创造出一片15尺半径的发光符文法阵。</p><p>在你处于这片区域期间，你的锤子会散发出相同的符文光芒，并使你用这把锤子发动的攻击检定与其伤害掷骰具有+3加值。</p><p>符文法阵会在创造的1分钟后消失，若你创造另一个符文法阵、或主动以附赠动作消解它，这个符文法阵就会提前消失。这把锤子在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d3]]发已被消耗的充能数。</p><p>This magic hammer has 3 charges. As a bonus action, you can expend 1 charge and slam this hammer on the ground, creating a 15-foot-radius circle of glowing runes centered on the point of impact. While you're inside that area, your hammer glows with matching runes, and you gain a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this hammer. The rune circle disappears after 1 minute, when you create another rune circle, or when you dismiss the rune circle as a bonus action. This hammer regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
